Third-Party Components

This repository vendors no third-party source. Its dependencies are installed
from npm at the versions pinned in pnpm-lock.yaml, each under its own license.

The service folder gardend runs (deploy/build-gardend-service.mjs) bundles
them: the orchestrator and the agent body are each one file built with
esbuild, and libSQL's native binding is carried as published. That folder's
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md names every bundled package with its license text;
deploy/third-party-licenses/ holds the texts of the few packages whose npm
tarballs ship none. The agent body is upstream pi:

- pi (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent, @earendil-works/pi-agent-core,
  @earendil-works/pi-ai 1.2.0, from npm)
